{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMO CONTENT</strong><br>This playable demo lets you experience the beginning of the adventure. It offers about 1 to 1.5 hours of gameplay and includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The introduction to the main story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of the castle\u2019s first areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several puzzles to solve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first encounters with enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core gameplay mechanics: non-linear exploration, resource management, environmental puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DIFFERENCES FROM THE FULL GAME</strong><br>Some advanced features (additional areas and gameplay mechanics, enemy types, etc.) are not present in this demo.<br>The content is limited to the opening section of the game and does not represent the full narrative or gameplay progression.<strong><br><br>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now that a snowstorm has devastated the region, the only way to continue your journey is through the castle of the mysterious Baron Fetuccini.  <br>Arriving at the castle, you discover a nightmare from which it seems impossible to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore varied labyrinthine environments in a non-linear way, solve puzzles and riddles, and carefully manage your resources in this survival horror game where the slightest encounter can be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is also a precious resource. Be careful, when night falls, you could find yourself facing the most dangerous threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOLVE THE MYSTERIES OF THE CASTLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet other characters who are also trapped on the island. Assisting them may help you unlock the secrets behind the mysterious Funskin project.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4058140?t=1759399939","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4058140?t=1759399939","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058140/92ae7288e394f2ca6fbee6224e6a8181f3d1412a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759399939","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058140/92ae7288e394f2ca6fbee6224e6a8181f3d1412a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759399939","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMO CONTENT</strong><br>This playable demo lets you experience the beginning of the adventure. It offers about 1 to 1.5 hours of gameplay and includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The introduction to the main story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of the castle\u2019s first areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several puzzles to solve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first encounters with enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core gameplay mechanics: non-linear exploration, resource management, environmental puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DIFFERENCES FROM THE FULL GAME</strong><br>Some advanced features (additional areas and gameplay mechanics, enemy types, etc.) are not present in this demo.<br>The content is limited to the opening section of the game and does not represent the full narrative or gameplay progression.<strong><br><br>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now that a snowstorm has devastated the region, the only way to continue your journey is through the castle of the mysterious Baron Fetuccini.  <br>Arriving at the castle, you discover a nightmare from which it seems impossible to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore varied labyrinthine environments in a non-linear way, solve puzzles and riddles, and carefully manage your resources in this survival horror game where the slightest encounter can be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is also a precious resource. Be careful, when night falls, you could find yourself facing the most dangerous threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOLVE THE MYSTERIES OF THE CASTLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet other characters who are also trapped on the island. Assisting them may help you unlock the secrets behind the mysterious Funskin project.</p>","developers":["Studio Richoux"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3232650","name":"The Funskin Project"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058140/0df34048979a61a50e26f877df485aa18092ea3c/header.jpg?t=1759399939","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4058140/1375057772/c73a6369d5d8e18ab11af1db0cfaa3d011a8108c/1758725173/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758807845","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4058140/1375057772/c73a6369d5d8e18ab11af1db0cfaa3d011a8108c/1758725173/dash_h264.mpd?t=17588